# 🌾 NAWAZ TRADERS ERP — VERCEL ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES (Copy-Paste into Vercel)
# ==============================================================================
# Instructions:
# 1. Open Vercel Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables.
# 2. Copy all key=value lines below and paste directly into the input box.
